# The fuzzer stubs use FUZZ_PARAM_STR and FUZZ_PARAM_FILENAME, both are satisfied
# by a bytes buffer that contains multiple null-terminated strings which the
# harness can slice from. We build a corpus-like buffer made of several NUL-terminated
# entries so that different pulls get meaningful values.

